---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE_AUTHOR } from "../consts";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about the Power BI Tutorials editorial team — experienced Power BI practitioners delivering accurate, practical tutorials for data analysts."
  article={true}
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <div class="content-width">
      <span class="page-eyebrow">About</span>
      <h1>We help data analysts master Power BI, faster.</h1>

      <p class="lede">
        Power BI Tutorials is an independent publication focused on practical,
        no-fluff tutorials for Power BI, DAX, and Power Query. We write the
        kind of guides we wish existed when we were learning — clear,
        example-driven, and grounded in real reporting problems.
      </p>

      <h2>Our editorial principles</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Accuracy first.</strong> Every DAX formula and Power Query step is tested against a real dataset before publication. If a pattern doesn't work as described, we don't publish it.</li>
        <li><strong>Practical over theoretical.</strong> We explain <em>why</em> a pattern works, but we always show <em>how</em> to use it — with copy-paste code and realistic scenarios.</li>
        <li><strong>Independently reviewed.</strong> We do not accept paid placements in our tutorials. Software comparisons reflect our genuine assessment. When a link is affiliate, we disclose it.</li>
        <li><strong>Continuously updated.</strong> Power BI ships monthly. We revisit and update tutorials as the product evolves, and mark each page with its last-reviewed date.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who writes this</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE_AUTHOR} is a group of Power BI practitioners with hands-on
        experience building enterprise reporting models across finance,
        operations, and sales analytics. Our background includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>10+ years combined experience building Power BI dashboards in production</li>
        <li>Microsoft Certified: Data Analyst Associate (PL-300)</li>
        <li>Experience migrating enterprise reporting from Excel/SSAS to Power BI</li>
        <li>Regular contributors to the Power BI community forums and local user groups</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="author-card">
        <div class="author-avatar" aria-hidden="true">PT</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Power BI Tutorials Editorial Team</h3>
          <p>
            We publish one new tutorial each week, typically on Tuesday.
            Have a topic request or spotted an error?
            <a href="/contact">Reach out here</a> — we read every message.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>How we fund this site</h2>
      <p>
        Power BI Tutorials is free to read. We're supported by display advertising
        (Google AdSense) and a small number of disclosed affiliate links
        for tools we genuinely use. Advertising never influences tutorial
        content or product recommendations. If you'd like to support us,
        the best way is to share a tutorial that helped you.
      </p>

      <h2>What's next</h2>
      <p>
        Our 2026 roadmap includes a complete DAX function reference, a
        pattern library for common business calculations, and downloadable
        .pbix sample files for every tutorial. Subscribe to the
        <a href="/#newsletter">newsletter</a> to follow along.
      </p>

      <div class="about-cta">
        <a href="/tutorials" class="btn btn-primary">Browse Tutorials</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page { padding: 56px 0 80px; }
  .page-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .about-page h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--c-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-accent);
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .about-page h2 { margin-top: 2.5em; }
  .author-card {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px;
    background: var(--c-bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .author-avatar {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c-accent);
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .author-card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .author-card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .about-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 11px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--c-accent); color: #fff; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--c-accent-hover); text-decoration: none; }
  .btn-secondary { background: var(--c-bg); color: var(--c-text); border-color: var(--c-border); }
  .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--c-accent); color: var(--c-accent); text-decoration: none; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-page h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; }
    .author-card { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    .about-cta { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
